      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "At size M the front and back panels are each 6 squares wide x 5 squares tall (60 x 50 cm). Total squares at size M: 60."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "To adjust size, add or remove one column. XS: 5 wide x 5 tall per panel. S: 5 wide x 5 tall. M: 6 wide x 5 tall. L: 7 wide x 5 tall. XL: 8 wide x 5 tall. 2XL: 9 wide x 5 tall."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
